# This repository can live directly in WoW's Interface\AddOns folder.
# Track only the Ravenquill Expedition suite; every other addon in the folder is ignored.
# WARNING: never run `git clean -x` / `-X` here - it would delete the other addons.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/scripts/
!/RavenquillExpedition/
!/RavenquillExpedition_Map/
!/RavenquillExpedition_Highlights/
!/RavenquillExpedition_CraftAdvisor/

# Internal working notes and assistant instructions: kept locally, not shared (for now).
PLAN.md
HANDOFF.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
# ...except the shared root CLAUDE.md, which Claude Code loads for every contributor.
!/CLAUDE.md

# Build output
/RavenquillExpedition/dev/release/
